WordHunterWoW_QuestEN[28937] = { title = "Alliance Breadcrumb", description = "Monsters!  They were monsters I tell you!\n\n Our ship pulled into port just south of Stromgarde, but the coast there is infested with strange creatures. \n\n Other than seeing their ugly mugs and hearing strange gurgling noises, I didn't wait to find out what they wanted. You'd better go help my shipmates, <name>!You will receive:\n\nUpon completion of this quest you will gain:", objectives = "Talk to Lady Gurga in Faldir's Cove.Monsters!  They were monsters I tell you!\n\n Our ship pulled into port just south of Stromgarde, but the coast there is infested with strange creatures. \n\n Other than seeing their ugly mugs and hearing strange gurgling noises, I didn't wait to find out what they wanted. You'd better go help my shipmates, <name>!You will receive:\n\nUpon completion of this quest you will gain:" }
